  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Di Moody WASH Project in Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Title : Di Moody Nakuruto WASH project Kenya Start and end dates: 01/01/2020 31/12/2020 (12 months) Pcode: P8132 Summary: The project is expected to increase access to clean and safe water and improved hygiene and sanitation among 11 000 women men girls and boys in Nakuruto through; Provision of water infrastructure; rehabilitation of Nakuruto borehole and pipeline extension to 20 villages Hygiene and sanitation promotion activities at community level &amp; in schools Strengthened governance and management of water facilities Location: Taita Taveta County Kenya Beneficiaries: 11 000 Donor: Di Moody Foundation &amp; PPL (RF) PNSs/Partners: KRCS Budget: 362 250 Current situation (Jan 2020): Assessments will take place in January 2020 with implementation starting in Q1 2020. An additional 12 250 is available from PPL and the BRC Nairobi &amp; KRCS team will prepare an additional budget for these extra funds.</narrative>
  </description>
